iolation interaction). Binary effect is the primary finding; type uniformity supports that ambiguity per se, not specific linguistic structures, drives violations.\\n  [plan_002 full study results](/api/workspace-files/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/plan_002/data/full_statistics.json) | [c3_layer_effect_test](/api/workspace-files/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/plan_002/report/layer_effect_test.json)\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 2 / 负向 3 / 失败 0 / 共 5\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\n（无服务器配置）\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NAfSUwSFFqdiz2bg84riqy","session_id":"bd96f57a-80ec-4566-95cb-ccf252e77f7a","uuid":"996971c9-a661-4461-ab56-9d11cdd29ced","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:51:35.912Z"}
