{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01T1fnF2WWDQ9VyEJMufbpvo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015keni1e9qJwyJ5BR1BsAoP","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"policy_ambiguity_safety","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1898,"cache_read_input_tokens":17991,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1898,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":52,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NAfSUwSFFqdiz2bg84riqy","session_id":"bd96f57a-80ec-4566-95cb-ccf252e77f7a","uuid":"571c43bc-1b30-4bc7-b4cc-561cb61d9aa5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015keni1e9qJwyJ5BR1BsAoP","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-4/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — policy_ambiguity_safety\\\\n\\\\n## 累积实验证据 (2026-05-20, plan_002 更新)\\\\n\\\\n**Type effect 存在（plan_002 确认，推翻 mvp_001/diag_001 的 null）**：\\\\n\\\\n| 实验 | N | 比较 | 效应量 | p 值 | 结论 |\\\\n|------|---|------|--------|------|------|\\\\n| mvp_001 | 360 | 3 types (scopal/lexical/incompleteness) | V=0.084 | 0.50 | 3 类 linguistic 无差异（巧合——选的 3 类恰好相似） |\\\\n| diag_001 | 200 | CP vs scopal | -6pp | 0.46 | 跨 layer 也无差异（但 N 太小只看了 2 类） |\\\\n| **plan_002** | **1200** | **6 types × 2 models** | **V=0.207** | **0.0001** | **Type hierarchy 存在。Specification > Linguistic** |\\\\n\\\\n**关键转折**: MVP 的 null 是采样偏差——恰好选了 3 个效应相近的类型。全 6 类加入后 auth_scope(55%) 和 coreferential(25%) 拉开了方差。\\\\n\\\\n**Binary effect 极强且稳健（6 种歧义类型一致）**：\\\\n- 总体: +36.5pp, McNemar OR=44.8, p<0.0001, Bootstrap CI: [+32.0pp, +40.5pp]\\\\n- 所有 6 类型 ambiguous vs unambiguous 均显著（最低 coreferential +16pp）\\\\n- Perturbation control (plan_010): Δ_perturb=3.33pp, PASS — 排除 prompt brittleness\\\\n\\\\n**Layer hierarchy（plan_002 新发现）**：\\\\n- Specification-layer avg Δ ≈ 46pp: auth_scope(+53pp) > incompleteness(+49pp) > CP(+35pp)\\\\n- Linguistic-layer avg Δ ≈ 27pp: scopal(+36pp) > lexical(+30pp) > coreferential(+16pp)\\\\n- Gap ≈ 19pp，specification 几乎是 linguistic 的 2 倍\\\\n\\\\n**Coreferential 作为边界案例**：25% violation rate（最低），agents 可部分通过 tool responses 消歧。定义 \\\\\\\"nocuous ambiguity boundary\\\\\\\"。\\\\n\\\\n**教训**：\\\\n- MVP 的 3-type 采样给出了 false null——全 taxonomy 覆盖对 type effect 结论至关重要\\\\n- 理论预测的违规率排序（CP > Scopal > ... > Lexical）仍不准确——但 layer-level 排序成立\\\\n- N=100/type 对 15pp 差异有足够 power，但需要 6 类全覆盖才能检测 heterogeneity\\\\n\\\\n## C5 Error Analysis 洞察 (2026-05-20, plan_005)\\\\n\\\\n**每种类型有独特的 dominant failure mode（诊断性签名）**：\\\\n- auth_scope → 71.9% unauthorized_escalation（扩大权限边界）\\\\n- incompleteness → 60.9% assumption_based_action（填补信息空白）\\\\n- scopal → 76.2% scope_misapplication（误判作用域）\\\\n- lexical → 71.4% assumption_based_action（将多义词当作信息缺口，出乎意料）\\\\n- CP → 41.2% scope_misapplication + 29.4% arbitrary_rule_selection（混合模式）\\\\n- coreferential → 分散（N=9 太小），但 11.1% conservative_refusal 是所有类型中最高\\\\n\\\\n**Spec vs Ling layer 的失败机制差异**：\\\\n- scope_misapplication: ling 46.5% vs spec 18.1% — 语言层歧义确实更多触发误解\\\\n- assumption_based_action: spec 31.6% ≈ ling 29.1% — 不是 layer-specific（lexical 的 71.4% 拉高了 ling avg）\\\\n- 关键区分不是 assumption vs misparse，而是 **failure mode 的类型特异性**\\\\n\\\\n**\\\\\\\"Ambiguity Blindness\\\\\\\" 实证确认**：\\\\n- Disambiguation awareness rate 全局 <5%，scopal/coreferential 为 0%\\\\n- Resolution strategy: surface_adoption >88% across all types\\\\n- Agent 几乎从不意识到歧义存在，从不主动向用户确认（escalate_to_user 仅 1/123 条）\\\\n- 这解释了为什么 binary effect 如此大：agent 没有 \\\\\\\"不确定时问\\\\\\\" 的机制\\\\n\\\\n**Coreferential 低 rate 的部分解释**：\\\\n- conservative_refusal: 11.1% vs 其他 avg 3.0% — 唯一有 \\\\\\\"暂停\\\\\\\" 行为的类型\\\\n- 但 N=9 太小，需要 plan_003 本地模型数据来确认这个 pattern\\\\n\\\\n**对论文的启示**：\\\\n- C5 应强调 type-specific failure signatures（每种类型坏在不同的地方），不仅是 \\\\\\\"spec>ling\\\\\\\"\\\\n- lexical 的 assumption_based_action 高达 71.4% 是个 surprise——词义歧义被 agent 当作信息缺失处理，值得在 Discussion 讨论\\\\n- \\\\\\\"Ambiguity Blindness\\\\\\\" 有硬数据支撑了（<5% awareness），可以从 concept 升级为 empirical finding\\\\n\\\\n## Taxonomy 设计决策 (2026-05-20)\\\\n\\\\n**6 类歧义 taxonomy**（2-layer 结构，D008 修正后）：\\\\n\\\\n**Layer 1 — Linguistic Ambiguity**: Scopal / Lexical / Coreferential\\\\n**Layer 2 — Specification Underspecification**: Incompleteness / Conditional Precedence / Authorization Scope\\\\n\\\\n操作性定义: \\\\\\\"任何导致 agent 产生 divergent policy interpretations 的文本欠定性\\\\\\\"（Wasow 2005, Kennedy 2007）\\\\n\\\\n**Taxonomy 价值**: 从\\\\\\\"系统性覆盖 + generalizability\\\\\\\"升级为\\\\\\\"证明 layer hierarchy 的结构基础\\\\\\\"。2-layer 结构不是任意分组——specification layer 确实比 linguistic layer 更危险。\\\\n\\\\n## API 接入配置 (2026-05-20)\\\\n\\\\n- 端点 `http://47.94.22.126/v1` 从 AWS 本机直连可达\\\\n- **禁止用 WebFetch 访问国内 IP**——必须用 Bash curl / Python requests\\\\n- 纯 OpenAI 代理，无 Claude。模型: gpt-5.4 + gpt-4.1\\\\n- 环境变量: `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`（key_id: `openrouter_api_key`）\\\\n- venv: `artifacts/.venv/bin/python`\\\\n- **Claude endpoint 不可用**: 测试了 5 个 Claude model ID 均超时，GPT 模型正常。Claude baseline 需要替代方案。\\\\n\\\\n## Phase 2b 本地推理代码 (2026-05-20)\\\\n\\\\n- `harness_local.py`: vLLM + Transformers 双后端\\\\n- `config_local.py`: Qwen3-8B (bf16) + Qwen3-32B-AWQ (int4)\\\\n- `setup_vllm.sh`: 自动 GPU 检测 + health check\\\\n\\\\n## Silent Failure Bug 教训 (2026-05-20)\\\\n\\\\nplan_010 v1 的 120 条 episode 全是假数据——API key 未设置导致静默失败。修复：\\\\n1. harness.py: `_get_client()` 缺 key 直接 raise；`validate_episode()` 检查 assistant 消息\\\\n2. run_*.py: preflight check + >5% error rate 拒绝生成 verdict\\\\n3. **永远在跑实验前 preflight check API connectivity**\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4148, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NAfSUwSFFqdiz2bg84riqy","session_id":"bd96f57a-80ec-4566-95cb-ccf252e77f7a","uuid":"a17af1a0-ac11-45f9-9286-90b030cf5da8","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:51:42.107Z"}
