{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VSgvHf2nPrMykJMrGaLyih","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-4/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 21\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 07:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 设计：3 类歧义 × 2 API 模型验证 type effect，不用 GPU\\\\n  rationale: 核心假设是\\\\\\\"歧义类型影响安全违规率\\\\\\\"。选 scopal/lexical/incompleteness 3 种假设差异最大的类型，用 frontier\\\\n    API 模型（免 GPU）快速验证信号存在性。60 条款 × 2 variants × 2 模型 = 240 runs，统计功效足够（χ² df=2, medium\\\\n    effect w=0.3, N=240 >> 所需 ~107）。Pass 条件：p<0.05 + V≥0.15。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 07:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 3 条修正：增条款数、调阈值、补 fail path\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer WARNING: (1) pairwise N=80 对 V=0.15 功效仅 0.22，增至 30 条款/类（pairwise\\\\n    N=120）+ 提阈值至 V≥0.20 + 明确 MVP 只检测 medium+ effect；(2) 补 fail path 三级决策树（扩大N重测 →\\\\n    pivot binary story → full study）；(3) 加 judge 偏差检查点（scopal 低于预期时先排查 judge bias）。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 07:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: ROADMAP 补充 H1-H4 预测基准和 post-MVP 18 周路径骨架\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer WARNING: (1) ROADMAP 缺 post-MVP 骨架，ICLR DDL 18 周后，需提前规划 GPU\\\\n    申请时间点（W3 MVP pass 后立即申请，W5 开始 Phase 2b）；(2) H1-H4 方向性预测未落地到 ROADMAP，Agent 解读 MVP\\\\n    结果时需对照基准（H1: scopal 最高，H2: lexical 最低，null: binary effect story）。paper_framing.md\\\\n    保持在 MVP 后创建。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 07:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 分析改为双轨：ambiguous-only 跨类型比较（主）+ matched-pair within-type（辅）\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer WARNING: incompleteness matched pair 存在信息量不对称混淆——消歧必然添加信息，与\\\\n    scopal/lexical 的\\\\\\\"同信息不同措辞\\\\\\\"baseline 不可比。解法：(1) 主分析用 ambiguous-only 条件直接跨类型比较违规率（不受信息量混淆）；(2)\\\\n    matched-pair 降为辅助的 within-type 效应量度量；(3) 要求 Agent 修订 incompleteness pairs 只添加解决歧义的最小信息；(4)\\\\n    效度边界显式声明此不对称性。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 07:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 使用 τ²-bench + 剥离 tool description 中的策略信息\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer WARNING: 需在 injection pipeline 前决定版本和 tool description 处理。选\\\\n    τ²-bench 因为 NL assertions 适合安全违规评估（v1 的 DB hash 太僵硬）。Tool description 中的策略信息会造成信息泄漏（agent\\\\n    绕过歧义策略从 tool desc 获取正确信息），选择剥离而非同步修改——更简单且信号更纯净。Airline 补偿条款可作为 scopal ambiguity\\\\n    paired pairs 起点。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 08:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: 目标会议从 ICLR 2027 切换至 EMNLP 2026（ARR Aug cycle）\\\\n  rationale: 用户指令 /venue emnlp-2026。DDL 从 Sep 24 (18 周) 压缩到 ~Aug 3 (10.5 周)。Post-MVP\\\\n    Phase 2 规模缩减（500 条款 vs 1000），时间窗压紧。EMNLP 2026 long paper 8 页 + unlimited refs，通过\\\\n    ARR 统一审稿。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 09:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: EMNLP 适配：保 6 类型、砍模型 6→4、砍条款 500→300、Phase 3 降级 PoC、CL-first 叙事\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer venue 影响评估：(1) EMNLP 比 ICLR 更适合本文（两条腿：语言学分析+实证安全），但需 CL-first\\\\n    framing（从 ambiguity detection/resolution 文献入手，safety 是 application context）；(2)\\\\n    6 类型是核心贡献不可砍，模型 6→4（2 API+2 开源）省 1/3 GPU、条款 500→300（50/type, pairwise N=200 power>0.9）边际收益小但成本线性、Phase\\\\n    3 降为 PoC 省 1 周给 error analysis；(3) 最终 2400 episodes 完全可行；(4) 8 页 fitting 需压 Related\\\\n    Work ≤1 页、taxonomy 用 table、per-model breakdown 放 appendix；(5) ARR 滚动机制是安全网（Aug\\\\n    不完美可改投 Oct→NAACL/ACL 2027）。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 09:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: Taxonomy 采用 2-layer 结构（3 linguistic + 3 specification）；开源模型定为 Qwen3-8B\\\\n    + Qwen3-32B(int4)\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 3 份审查综合：(1) Taxonomy: authorization scope 在 CL 传统中是 vagueness\\\\n    非 ambiguity，conditional precedence 是规范冲突非语言学歧义——2-layer 分类（linguistic: scopal/lexical/coreferential\\\\n    + specification: incompleteness/conditional precedence/authorization scope）比扁平\\\\n    6 类更诚实、对 EMNLP 审稿人更有防御力；需加 ambiguity-vagueness 操作性定义声明（ref Wasow 2005）；(2) 硬件:\\\\n    RTX PRO 6000 48GB 上 DeepSeek-V3 不可行、Qwen3-32B 需 int4，可行组合 Qwen3-8B(bf16 16GB)\\\\n    + Qwen3-32B(int4 ~18GB)，同家族不同 scale 可做 scale analysis；(3) API model ID 20260620\\\\n    是未来日期需验证。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 09:42 UTC\\\\n  summary: API 阻塞解除：ECONNREFUSED 是 WebFetch 代理问题，端点从本机可达，MVP 可启动\\\\n  rationale: 用户确认 http://47.94.22.126/v1 从 AWS 本机直连正常（curl 返回 401 要求 auth header）。之前\\\\n    Worker 用 WebFetch 工具（走 Anthropic 海外代理）访问国内 IP 被拒。后续涉及国内 IP 的操作必须用 Bash curl。MVP\\\\n    唯一阻塞项消除，指令 Agent 立即验证端点 + 启动 360 episodes。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 10:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 改用 gpt-5.4 + gpt-4.1（端点无 Claude），立即启动\\\\n  rationale: 端点 47.94.22.126 是纯 OpenAI 代理，无 Anthropic 模型。MVP 目标是检测 type effect 信号非跨厂商泛化。gpt-5.4\\\\n    + gpt-4.1 提供同厂不同代际对比，交叉 judge 可行（gpt-5.4 ep → gpt-4.1 judge，反之亦然）。统计功效充足（180 ambiguous\\\\n    ep, 60/type, omnibus power>0.95）。Claude 留 full study 做跨厂商验证。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 10:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP FAIL on type effect → pivot to binary anchor + diagnostic for layer\\\\n    effect + full study\\\\n  rationale: MVP 结果：type effect p=0.50 V=0.084（FAIL），binary effect +35-42pp p<1e-5（极强）。V=0.084\\\\n    远低于阈值，扩 N 无意义（Fail path L1 跳过）。决策：(1) binary effect 作为论文主 claim 锚点——\\\\\\\"歧义策略导致大规模安全违规\\\\\\\"；(2)\\\\n    跑 diagnostic：conditional precedence（specification layer, 预测最高违规率）vs scopal（linguistic\\\\n    layer 最高），N=50/type，验证 2-layer 之间是否有 type effect；(3) 无论 diagnostic 结果如何都进 full\\\\n    study——binary effect 本身已 justify；(4) full study 中 type analysis 改为 exploratory（effect\\\\n    size + error analysis），不作为 confirmatory primary claim。符合 IDEA_BRIEF null-result\\\\n    预承诺：\\\\\\\"binary detection may suffice\\\\\\\"。CL-first 叙事不变——error analysis 是 EMNLP 核心期待。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_001\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: type_effect_fail_binary_pass\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 10:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: Full study 新增 model×type interaction 作为正式分析维度\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查 mvp_001 发现 gpt-5.4 scopal 60% vs lexical 40%（20pp gap, H1\\\\n    方向），而 gpt-4.1 完全扁平（40-47%）。\\\\\\\"Type sensitivity 作为 model capability 的函数\\\\\\\"比单纯 type\\\\n    effect 更有深度，更适合 EMNLP。Full study 4 模型（2 API 不同代际 + 2 开源不同规模）× 6 类型可正式检验交互效应。同时论文报告\\\\n    unambiguous baseline 违规率 ~8%（14/180），净歧义效应 ~34-44pp。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_001\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: model_type_interaction_signal\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 11:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'diag_001 FAIL: layer effect 不存在，C3 死亡。Paper framing 确认 binary anchor +\\\\n    type uniformity null + visibility insight'\\\\n  rationale: diag_001 结果：CP 34% vs scopal 40%，Δ=-6pp（方向相反），p=0.464。结合 mvp_001（层内无差异\\\\n    p=0.50），两轮实验收敛：歧义对 agent 安全的影响与类型完全无关（uniform effect）。C3（layer effect）正式死亡。但 Reviewer\\\\n    发现有价值的 CL insight：CP < scopal 可能因为显式规则冲突对模型 \\\\\\\"可见\\\\\\\"（meta-cognitive awareness），而语法歧义\\\\n    \\\\\\\"隐形\\\\\\\"。Full study 中若复现，可作为论文讨论亮点。test-retest 波动 ±8pp 需要 full study 加 bootstrap CI。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: diag_001\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'negative: CP 34% vs scopal 40%, p=0.464, layer effect FAIL'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_001\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: 'negative: type effect p=0.50, binary effect +35-42pp'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 12:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream dream_20260520T112859 分析完成：best 3.5 / median 3.0 / worst 2.5，threshold\\\\n    met (best≥3.5, median≥2.5)。12 条确认行动项已持久化到 framing+plan，6 条观察项记录待真实实验验证。批准 P0 实验启动。\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream 三档评分满足 post-MVP kickoff 阈值（best≥weak accept 且 median≥borderline）。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    确认行动项（已执行）：\\\\n\\\\n    A1: 标题从 \\\\\\\"All Ambiguity Is Nocuous\\\\\\\" 软化为 \\\\\\\"Policy Ambiguity Is Uniformly Nocuous\\\\\\\"（三档一致\\\\n    overclaim 反馈）\\\\n\\\\n    A2: 引用列表扩展要求（≥25 篇，补 good-enough processing/instruction-following/prompt sensitivity/garden-path\\\\n    等）\\\\n\\\\n    A3: C2/C3 增加 power analysis，报告 MDE\\\\n\\\\n    A4: TOST margin 双重检验（±15pp + ±10pp），显式 justify\\\\n\\\\n    A5: C3 明确标注 EXPLORATORY + post-diagnostic，p-value 需 caution\\\\n\\\\n    A6: Code/data release 承诺（clause pairs + eval scripts + analysis code + trace samples）\\\\n\\\\n    A7: plan_009 judge calibration P1→P0（best 档 \\\\\\\"single most critical missing validation\\\\\\\"）\\\\n\\\\n    A8: C2/C3 关系显式讨论（omnibus vs planned pairwise 答不同问题）\\\\n\\\\n    A9: 新增 RC11 prompt sensitivity confound + plan_010 perturbation control arm (P1)\\\\n\\\\n    A10: plan_004 增加 incompleteness information delta 量化\\\\n\\\\n    A11: 52% coreferential fix rate 作为 limitation 讨论\\\\n\\\\n    A12: 6 个必需 figure plan\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    观察项（等真实实验）：\\\\n\\\\n    O1: V trend — 如 V>0.20 则 C2 null rejected，需 worst-tier reframing\\\\n\\\\n    O2: Error analysis IAA — 如 κ<0.60 则 C5 降级为 supplementary\\\\n\\\\n    O3: Visibility p-value — 如 p>0.10 保持 exploratory，p<0.05 考虑升级\\\\n\\\\n    O4: Classifier F1 — 如<0.75 移入 appendix\\\\n\\\\n    O5: Realism validation KS — 如 2+ tests fail 需 length-matched subset\\\\n\\\\n    O6: Model×type interaction significance\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    忽略项（有理由）：\\\\n\\\\n    I1: Flat unambiguous baselines — median-only, imagined data artifact\\\\n\\\\n    I2: Page limit — writing phase处理\\\\n\\\\n    I3: r_s on n=4 — worst-only, 不会在实际论文中这么做\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    不需要 re-dream 的理由：变更均为 clarification/addition 而非结构性 framing 重构；评分已达标；核心 story（binary\\\\n    effect + uniformity null + visibility exploratory）未改变。Plan 变更为 priority 调整和 P1\\\\n    新增，不影响已有 P0 实验设计。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260520T112859\\\\n    role: dream simulation\\\\n    result: best 3.5 / median 3.0 / worst 2.5\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 12:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Coreferential Path A (三层修复): tool responses 泄漏消歧线索是 mini-pilot v2 FAIL\\\\n    根因，需修复 tool responses + scenario + 行为可区分性。plan_010 升 P0 并移到 plan_002/003 之前执行。'\\\\n  rationale: 'Mini-pilot v2 结果 1/5 (20%)，根因不是条款文本（已审计修复 26/50），而是 τ²-bench 框架层面的系统性问题：(1)\\\\n    tool responses 返回结构化字段直接消歧（如 explicit ages, wrong_item_received 状态），(2) 部分条款两种解读导致相同\\\\n    action，(3) 模型可通过保守策略避开歧义点。Reviewer 独立确认了 Agent 的根因分析。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    选择 Path A（修复）而非 B（缩减）或 C（降级），因为：\\\\n\\\\n    - 6 类型均衡是 taxonomy 核心结构\\\\n\\\\n    - 如果 coreferential 系统性偏低会产生伪 type effect，破坏 C2 (uniformity null)\\\\n\\\\n    - 2-3h worker 时间是 trivial 投入\\\\n\\\\n    - 修复方向正确（确保实验框架不 bias 特定类型）\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    plan_010 升 P0 的理由（Reviewer warning）：如果 perturbation control 显示 prompt brittleness\\\\n    也导致 +30pp，则 full study 2,400 episodes 全部无效。先投入 30 pairs + 120 episodes 验证因果性，再投入大规模实验。成本-信息比极高。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001b\\\\n    role: mini-pilot v2\\\\n    result: FAIL 1/5 (20%)\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_010\\\\n    role: causal validation\\\\n    result: upgraded P1→P0, must run before plan_002/003\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 13:46 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'plan_010 perturbation control: 5-tier judgment criteria adopted, CI-based\\\\n    over p-value, Δ_net as primary metric'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer assessment refined original 3-tier to 5-tier (PASS/PASS+caveat/CONDITIONAL/WARNING/FAIL)\\\\n    based on Δ_perturb/Δ_ambiguity ratio. Key insight: N=120 has only ~30% power for\\\\n    10pp difference, so CI width is the decision metric, not p-value. If CI >15pp\\\\n    width, expand N by 60 episodes. Primary metric is Δ_net = Δ_ambiguity - Δ_perturb\\\\n    (net ambiguity-specific effect). Also added contingency framing to paper_framing.md\\\\n    for scenarios where full study deviates from MVP (2/6 types fail → differential\\\\n    nocuity pivot; uniformity rejected → type hierarchy pivot).'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_010\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: judgment criteria defined\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 14:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claude Sonnet 4.6 added as 5th model via OpenRouter proxy, plan_002 expanded\\\\n    to 1,800 episodes, plan_010 to 180 episodes\\\\n  rationale: 'Distill gap: 4/8 peer papers use Claude baseline, our plan had 0 Claude\\\\n    models. User provided API key for OpenRouter proxy (base_url=http://47.94.22.126/v1).\\\\n    Claude Sonnet 4.6 chosen as comparable to gpt-4.1 tier, cost-effective for 600\\\\n    additional episodes. Total model coverage now 5 models × 3 families (OpenAI/Anthropic/Qwen),\\\\n    addressing RC from distilled literature. API cost increase ~$100 (50% of plan_002),\\\\n    justified by closing the most significant baseline gap.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_002\\\\n    role: expanded\\\\n    result: 3 API models\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_010\\\\n    role: expanded\\\\n    result: 3 API models\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 14:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_010 PASS (Δ_perturb=0pp, verdict=PASS), plan_002 approved for immediate\\\\n    launch with 2 API models\\\\n  rationale: 'plan_010 perturbation control: 120 episodes, all violation_level=none.\\\\n    Synonym substitution and clause reordering produce zero violations across both\\\\n    models. Δ_perturb=0pp vs ambiguity Δ=38pp → ratio=0.0, strongest possible PASS.\\\\n    Causal claim fully validated: the +38pp effect is entirely ambiguity-specific,\\\\n    not general prompt brittleness. plan_002 all prerequisites met: 300 clauses ready,\\\\n    pipeline code complete, perturbation control passed. Launching with gpt-5.4 +\\\\n    gpt-4.1 (1,200 episodes); Claude 600 episodes deferred until endpoint resolved.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_010\\\\n    role: completed\\\\n    result: PASS, Δ_perturb=0pp\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_002\\\\n    role: approved\\\\n    result: launching 1,200 episodes\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 14:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'plan_010 v2 PASS (real data): Δ_perturb=3.33pp, CI=[-5,13.33] contains\\\\n    0, ratio=8.8%. plan_002 re-approved.'\\\\n  rationale: 'plan_010 v2 with fixed code (preflight + validation + error guard).\\\\n    120 real episodes with actual agent responses. Δ_perturb=3.33pp < 5pp threshold,\\\\n    CI contains 0, ratio=0.088 < 0.15 → PASS (strongest form). CI width 18.33pp >\\\\n    15pp flagged as underpowered but not actionable: even CI upper bound (13.33pp)\\\\n    gives Δ_net=24.67pp, far exceeding 20pp threshold. Causal claim validated: ambiguity-specific\\\\n    effect confirmed. D018 superseded (was based on fake data). plan_002 re-approved\\\\n    for immediate launch.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_010\\\\n    role: completed\\\\n    result: PASS, Δ=3.33pp real data\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_002\\\\n    role: re-approved\\\\n    result: launching 1,200 episodes\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 15:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Major framing pivot: \\\\\\\"Uniform Nocuity\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"Differential Nocuity\\\\\\\" after\\\\n    C2 falsified (V=0.207). Layer hierarchy confirmed: Spec ~46pp >> Ling ~27pp.'\\\\n  rationale: 'plan_002 (1,200 episodes) falsified C2 type uniformity: omnibus χ²=25.61,\\\\n    p=0.0001, V=0.207. Clear layer hierarchy: specification-layer avg Δ≈46pp (auth_scope\\\\n    53pp, incompleteness 49pp, CP 35pp) vs linguistic-layer avg Δ≈27pp (scopal 36pp,\\\\n    lexical 30pp, coreferential 16pp). This matches pre-planned Contingency Scenario\\\\n    C. Framing pivoted: title, core insight, C2 (null→positive), C3 (visibility→layer\\\\n    effect), concept naming (Uniform→Differential Nocuity + Disambiguation Channel\\\\n    Hypothesis), narrative structure, RC1 updated. This is a STRONGER paper — type\\\\n    hierarchy with linguistic explanation is more informative than uniform null. Re-dream\\\\n    recommended to validate new framing.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_002\\\\n    role: completed\\\\n    result: C1 confirmed +36.5pp, C2 FALSIFIED V=0.207\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_001\\\\n    role: superseded\\\\n    result: C2 null was artifact of 3-type coincidence\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 14699, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NAfSUwSFFqdiz2bg84riqy","session_id":"bd96f57a-80ec-4566-95cb-ccf252e77f7a","uuid":"9984e858-bd24-485d-83e1-3d7dab31405c","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:52:37.750Z"}
